<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Eastern Cement 96 net profit up, div flat.</title>
<headline>Saudi Eastern Cement 96 net profit up, div flat.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  274.2	vs     270.7</p>
<p> Sales			 512.7	vs     495.3</p>
<p> Costs			 225.9	vs     208.1</p>
<p> Other income		 23.3	vs	21.9</p>
<p> Total dividend	    225.75     vs	same</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   1,050.5	vs   1,003.4</p>
<p> Assets		    1,347.5	vs   1,297.6</p>
<p>Full Name: The Eastern Province Cement Company</p>
<p>Note: The Dammam-based firm, traded in the Saudi stock market, is one of eight cement companies operating in Saudi.</p>
</text>
